### Register a new member - Created (200 OK, but often 201 Created for resource creation)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "John",
  "lastName": "Doe",
  "membershipType": "PREMIUM",
  "email": "john.doe@example.com",
  "phoneNumber": "123-456-7890",
  "username": "johndoe_new",
  "password": "password"
}

### Register a new member - Username already exists (400 Bad Request)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Jane",
  "lastName": "Doe",
  "membershipType": "BASIC",
  "email": "jane.doe@example.com",
  "phoneNumber": "098-765-4321",
  "username": "johndoe_new",
  "password": "anotherpassword"
}

### Register a new member - Validation Error (400 Bad Request)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "",
  "lastName": "Doe",
  "membershipType": "PREMIUM",
  "email": "invalid-email",
  "phoneNumber": "123",
  "username": "short",
  "password": ""
}
